{
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Configuration comparison",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "quotes": [
            "omen-dense-27b = { status = 'live', context_tokens = 65536, parallel_slots = 2, max_tokens = 16384 }",
            "omen-perception = { status = 'live', parallel_slots = 2 }",
            "for bname, bspec in sorted(cspec.get('backends', {}).items()):",
            "if st == 'live':",
            "val += f' status={st} ctx={bspec.get('context_tokens')} slots={bspec.get('parallel_slots')} max_tokens={bspec.get('max_tokens')}'"
          ],
          "text": "The audit compares the backends declared under configuration.day and configuration.tool-night in host/lab-configurations.toml against the sizing parameters and invariants in tools/ops/sizing_map.py. The tool reads each named configuration's backends and, for live backends, records status, context_tokens, parallel_slots, and max_tokens; for absent backends it records status only. Its whole-lab invariants use only the active configuration to build expected live and absent sets and check live serving, absent routability, and family resolution; for AM4, am4-vllm is mapped to the am4-dense-27b facade alias. It does not directly diff day against tool-night, and it does not compare the TOML's declared numbers to backends-linux.toml."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Declared values",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "quotes": [
            "omen-dense-27b = { status = 'live', context_tokens = 65536, parallel_slots = 2, max_tokens = 16384 }",
            "omen-perception = { status = 'live', parallel_slots = 2 }"
          ],
          "text": "In both configurations, omen-dense-27b is live with context_tokens 65536, parallel_slots 2, and max_tokens 16384. omen-perception is live in both with parallel_slots 2; context_tokens and max_tokens are not declared for it in either configuration."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Status changes",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "quotes": [
            "am4-vllm = { status = 'live', context_tokens = 16384, parallel_slots = 1, max_tokens = 4096 }",
            "am4-tool-4070ti = { status = 'absent' }",
            "am4-tool-5070 = { status = 'absent' }",
            "am4-vllm = { status = 'absent' }",
            "am4-tool-4070ti = { status = 'live', context_tokens = 24576, parallel_slots = 3, max_tokens = 4096 }",
            "am4-tool-5070 = { status = 'live', context_tokens = 16384, parallel_slots = 1, max_tokens = 6144 }"
          ],
          "text": "When the lab moves from day to tool-night, three backends change status: am4-vllm changes from live to absent, while am4-tool-4070ti and am4-tool-5070 change from absent to live. omen-vllm, omen-dense-27b, fx99-vllm, and omen-perception remain live. Under day, the active-configuration invariants would expect am4-vllm live and the two AM4 tool seats absent; under tool-night, they would expect the two AM4 tool seats live and am4-vllm absent."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The audit compares the day and tool-night whole-lab configurations in host/lab-configurations.toml with the sizing parameters and invariants in tools/ops/sizing_map.py. It reports the declared context_tokens, parallel_slots, and max_tokens for omen-dense-27b and omen-perception in both configurations, and identifies which backends change between live and absent when the lab moves from day to tool-night."
}
